{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act18side_level_act18side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act18side",
  "stageId": "act18side_05",
  "title": "月光",
  "storyCode": "LE-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "41f56e60d7350f84f5563727fe0207ca1d4edba452bf6335432ffaba97a2b5d4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "你現在感覺怎麼樣，沒問題了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "沒問題......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "沒問題的，一定沒問題的。你和我都會沒問題的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "我出去一會兒，你好好在這兒待著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "你才剛好一點，這是要去哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "......去辦事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "不管什麼事，都等到你恢復再說吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "不用擔心我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "芙蓉也說了，如果醒了，最好休息一段時間，觀察一下情況......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "這是急事，很急的事，好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "可是我們離音樂會已經沒多長時間了。我覺得現在最重要的還是把身體養好，加緊練習......這也是你的願望啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "現在就別拿這個煩我了，好不好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "煩？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "......我不是這個意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "但我確實非去不可，別攔著我了。我會儘快回來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "真的......不能告訴我要去做什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "如果一切順利的話......你會知道的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "對了，衣服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "衣服？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "約好今天下午去取的，我沒法陪你去了，你自己去一趟吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "記得帶大提琴，試穿的時候試著拉一小段，看看會不會有不舒服的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "我走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "text": "又是你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "......是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我來請求您停辦這次音樂會，至少不要讓黑鍵和白堊在音樂會上合奏了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "text": "你說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "如果讓黑鍵和白堊合奏，夕照區會出大事的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "text": "按你的說法，我最近身體好轉，是因為黑鍵和白堊引發的所謂“假癒”，但假癒期一過去，我就會變成重症患者，命在旦夕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "是的，您和他們接觸很多，因此症狀也更明顯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "text": "其他和他們接觸較少的人也會受到影響，如果放任他們合奏，很可能有人死去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "是的。雖然原因尚不明確，但讓這兩個人在一起合奏，有很大可能增強他們對周圍的影響。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "text": "多大可能？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "暫時還不知道......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "text": "除了我，還有誰會因此面臨生命危險？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "......夕照區的十多人已經被送去高庭區的醫院了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "text": "高庭區......也就是說，他們已經離開了黑鍵和白堊的影響範圍？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "應該是這樣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "text": "我明白你的意思了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "那麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "text": "不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "什麼？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我不奢求您取消整場音樂會，但就算單獨把黑鍵和白堊合奏的曲目撤了也好！或者換人也可以！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "text": "如果你能證明他們的合奏一定會導致我以外的人受害，我立刻就取消這場音樂會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "text": "但現在不同，連你也無法得知合奏的後果究竟是什麼。我不能僅僅因為虛無縹緲的“擔憂”，就讓整個夕照區的努力和希望付諸東流。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "整個夕照區的努力和希望？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我理解您對這次音樂會的重視程度，但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "text": "你不理解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "text": "如果你真的理解，就不會輕飄飄地說出那個“但是”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "text": "很遺憾，我不能僅憑你的一面之詞改動音樂會的安排。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "車爾尼先生，請您直接告訴我，這次音樂會和感染者的生命相比，究竟重要在什麼地方？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "text": "你什麼意思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "text": "你是想說我漠視生命？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我只是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "text": "芙蓉，芙蓉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "烏爾蘇拉婆婆？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "text": "走，和我出去吹吹風，好不好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "可是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "text": "走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "text": "出去冷靜一下，然後再說也不遲，好不好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "（如果格特魯德說的全部都是真的，白堊不可能活下來......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "（不，一定有什麼辦法的......兩全其美的辦法......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "（車爾尼，車爾尼說不定能知道什麼......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "（不，他只是個音樂家，他幫不上忙的。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "（我要不要告訴白堊實情——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "（可那又有什麼用呢......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "（羅德島......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "（芙蓉那種人，只會讓我回烏提卡繼續坐牢！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "（女皇之聲？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "（我到底在想什麼，自殺計畫嗎？！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "（不行，我一直在這兒兜圈子，實在太可疑了。我得換個人少的地方......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "（嗯？那人有點眼熟。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的貴族",
      "text": "......謹慎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "......人群......保證。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "（對了，謠言，那個謠言！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "（把謠言查清楚，說不定能獲得什麼線索，或者知道散佈謠言的人是在傳遞什麼資訊！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "（但現在只能靠我自己了......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的貴族",
      "text": "你確定？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "現在就是最好的時機了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "再拖下去，時間越來越少，到那時就不好辦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的貴族",
      "text": "那好，你儘管去做，我去向上面報告。加油，拉赫曼先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "text": "唉，這活可真是勞心又勞力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "text": "散佈流言也就罷了，現在還要去那種地方......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "（下水道？他要進下水道？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "（我可不想跟他進去......該動手了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "站住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "text": "誰？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "別回頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "說，是什麼人派你來夕照區傳播謠言的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "text": "冤枉啊，我不過是道聼塗説......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "我跟了你一路了，拉赫曼先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "而且我剛剛認出來，之前傳播謠言圍攻芙蓉的時候，你是煽風點火的那一個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "text": "您記性不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "說說吧，誰派你做這些事的，你進下水道要做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "正好，我也很好奇，拉赫曼先生進下水道要做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "別回頭，否則......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "會怎麼樣呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
